			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Barrow Deeps are the lowest reaches of the barrows of the {link:night-elves}night elves{/link}, far beneath the dens where their druids slept. The kaldorei did not dig them for the living. For ten thousand years they held a single prisoner: {link:illidan-stormrage}Illidan Stormrage{/link}, the Betrayer. Few went down into them, and fewer spoke of what they had seen. Now their silence is broken, and only a small, hardened band may hope to walk them.]=],
