			text = [=[The barrow dens were made for the druids of {link:malfurion-stormrage}Malfurion Stormrage{/link}. After the {link:war-of-the-ancients}War of the Ancients{/link}, the druids gave themselves to a long sleep. Their spirits wandered the {link:emerald-dream}Emerald Dream{/link}, while their bodies rested in halls of root and stone. Among them slept the Druids of the Claw, druids who could take the shape of the great bear.

Deeper still lay a darker work. When {link:illidan-stormrage}Illidan{/link} made a new Well upon {link:mount-hyjal}Mount Hyjal{/link}, Malfurion judged it a crime against the world. He had his brother chained beneath the earth, in a prison below the barrows. Maiev Shadowsong and her wardens were set to keep him there, and they kept him for ten thousand years. In all that time the druids slept on in the dens above him.]=],
